    "texture_size": [
     512,
     512
    ]
   }
  }
 },
 "created": "2026-10-18",
 "how_to_use": [
  "1. The suite (packages/creation-suite/src/parts.js) loads this registry.",
  "2. Texture parts: resolveEntry(entry, charId) merges the character's mapping; swapTexture() replaces the texture live \u2014 swap back restores the original (nothing overwritten).",
  "3. Mesh parts: attachPart() routes to attach() at the registry socket (bone aliases shared across rigs) with optional fit=headHeight auto-scale.",
  "4. Web UI (customization/create-fighter/): Catalog gains the eyes / decals / masks categories sourced from the same entries."
 ],
